# body-1kb - POST 1 KB of opaque random bytes (application/octet-stream).
# Replaces the old scenarios/body-1kb.env. Unlike json-1kb this body is NOT
# parseable, so it measures body transfer + buffering cost without the JSON
# parser or the per-argument rules. Use json-1kb for realistic body cost.
METHOD=""
REQ_PATH="/"
PAYLOAD_SIZE="1024"
